      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "トルス",
        "Emt1_Nor",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "この辺りには、よく人間の冒険者たちが来るんだ。\n「お宝探し」とか「モンスター娘討伐」とか言ってさ。",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "トルス",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "82e04bbd4f697c07683695fbb04505565faee028d76f7d0b9be98a2485f7ba82",
